WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.625 line:90%
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:00.625 --> 00:00:03.300 line:84%
VICTOR DAVIS HANSON: If you
lose the idea of citizenship,

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.370 line:90%
then you don't have a country.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.860 line:84%
We are living in
a country that has

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.530 line:84%
no resemblance to the
visions of the Founding

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.230 line:84%
Fathers and the first
200 years of our history.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:15.150 line:84%
It's so insidious
and incremental

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:17.310 line:90%
we don't even appreciate it.

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:20.670 line:84%
This course chronicles
how we, American citizens,

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.560 line:84%
are losing our
privileges, our rights,

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.800 line:84%
and our responsibilities
under the Constitution.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.650 line:90%
Let's begin.

